# Privacy Policy
Renewal cares about your privacy. Keep reading to learn about our Privacy Policy for the Discord bot Circa.

To provide a seamless experience between Discord and the gameplay, we collect the following:

* Discord User ID: Your unique Discord account identifier, which is automatically captured and copied when you interact with the binding commands. We then store your Discord User ID in a secure database table and link it directly to your in-game user.

The data we collect is used strictly for functional purposes within the game and Discord specifically to:

* Distinguish between individual players and verify identities.
* Link your Discord account to your individual in-game profile.
* Allow you to execute specific Discord commands like guild invites, view in-game progress, and link your PSN to your already existing account.


How do we collect your data, and how to remove it?

* Your data is collected only if you link an in-game character and keep it linked. You may request data deletion at any time using the command for it.

Who do we share with?

* We do not sell, trade, rent, or otherwise share your Discord ID, in-game character data, or any related information with third parties.

If you have any questions or concerns, please reach out to us via https://discord.gg/U4pjzmzUVx through the mod mail ticket system.



